Design: I propose integrating CutMix augmentation into the training loop to further regularize the model and improve generalization. With a CutMix probability of 0.5 and Beta(1.0,1.0), we randomly mix images and labels per batch, adjusting the loss accordingly with Focal Loss. This change works alongside the existing WeightedRandomSampler and multi‐angle TTA to potentially boost CV AUROC without altering the validation or prediction logic. Below is the modified end‐to‐end training script with CutMix implemented.
Code: import os
